    "tool_surface_evidence": "Taken off the wire against the rebuilt token-free image: three fresh sessions each observed 26 names and schema digest d0d3891a..., with read, write and shell demonstrated behaviourally. The settings bound here carry `security.auth.apiKey = apoapsis-local-nonsecret-placeholder`: a public, non-secret literal that authenticates nothing, grants no external access, reaches only the loopback forwarder in front of the controller-owned relay, is never sourced from the host environment, and exists solely because Qwen 0.21.1 refuses to start without a non-empty value. See ADR 0090. The scripted provider observed exactly `Bearer apoapsis-local-nonsecret-placeholder` and classified it as a declared placeholder. `no-token-environment` is unchanged and now passes against the rebuilt image. `tool_search` is correctly absent. `web_fetch` is present and was refused on every egress category."
  },
